{title: This Little Light of Mine}
{artist: Traditional spiritual}
{genre: Gospel}
{style: Traditional}
{flow: Closing}
{key: G}
{tempo: 108}
{time: 4/4}

{start_of_chorus}
This little [G]light of mine, I'm gonna let it shine
This little light of [C]mine, I'm gonna let it [G]shine
This little light of mine, I'm gonna let it [Em]shine
Let it [G]shine, let it [D]shine, let it [G]shine
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
Everywhere I [G]go, I'm gonna let it shine
Everywhere I [C]go, I'm gonna let it [G]shine
Everywhere I go, I'm gonna let it [Em]shine
Let it [G]shine, let it [D]shine, let it [G]shine
{end_of_verse}

{chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
Hide it under a [G]bushel? No! I'm gonna let it shine
Hide it under a [C]bushel? No! I'm gonna let it [G]shine
Hide it under a bushel? No! I'm gonna let it [Em]shine
Let it [G]shine, let it [D]shine, let it [G]shine
{end_of_verse}

{chorus}
